Third-party notices
===================

Nightshift includes material adapted from the third-party projects below. Each entry names what was taken, where it lives here, and
the project's license text as it was published.

(Agent definitions adapted from affaan-m/ecc are noted separately in .claude/agents/ECC-NOTICE.md.)

Ported source code follows CLAUDE.md's "Reuse before you build": MIT, Apache-2.0 and BSD only, with the notice kept here and a
header comment in every file that carries ported code. Packages that are only
installed from npm and not copied keep their own licence files in node_modules; they are listed here when a ported file
depends on them.

Excluded on licence grounds (their code is never copied, by rule): Aceternity UI (its own proprietary "Aceternity License",
no redistribution of source or derivatives) and React Bits (MIT with the Commons Clause, which forbids redistributing the
components "as a ported version"). Magic UI Pro is a separate, proprietary product; only the MIT repository is used.

