HKUDS/ViMax
https://github.com/HKUDS/ViMax (commit 01b4696ebb54805dc465f5f815f5ee87891909d8)

What was taken: the storyboard rules and the shot decomposition of agents/storyboard_artist.py
(system_prompt_template_design_storyboard, system_prompt_template_decompose_visual_description, and the
first-frame / last-frame / motion / variation_type fields of VisDescDecompositionResponse and interfaces/shot_description.py),
adapted into prompt text and TypeScript types.

Where: command-center/lib/brain/prompt.ts (PLAN_SYSTEM_PROMPT, "How you shoot"), command-center/lib/brain/logic.ts (the shot
spec types), command-center/lib/brain/plan.ts (the checks of those rules).

